                <h1>About</h1>
                <p>
                    Soft Colors turns your color palette into soft pastels.
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    It is a minimal, framework-less app that utilizes the <a href="https://color.pizza/">Color Name
                        API</a> for specific color names.
                    <br>
                    <br>
                    <br>
